      "text": [
        "994 - وَقَالَ أَمِيرُ اَلْمُؤْمِنِينَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «سَجْدَتَا اَلسَّهْوِ بَعْدَ اَلتَّسْلِيمِ وَ قَبْلَ اَلْكَلاَمِ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.994 - The Commander of the Faithful Imam Ali ibn Abi Talib (as) said:\n\"The two prostrations of forgetfulness (Sajdah al-Sahw) are after the Tasleem (salutation) and before speaking.\""
        ]
      }
